cuems-midi-connector (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging (dh-virtualenv).
  * Restructure to src/cuemsmidiconnector/ layout; drop dead synth-editor
    cruft (const.py, midiutils.py, python_alsa_midi.py).
  * Fix always-true pattern match; load wiring rules from
    /etc/cuems/midiconnector.conf with package-data fallback.
  * Detect controller role via /etc/cuems/master.ip presence (re-evaluated
    per event to support runtime role-flips).
  * SignalEngine integration with sd_notify READY=1.
  * Downgrade transient ALSA seq client errors to debug log level.
  * Add pytest suite for config parser, role detection, and pattern routing.

